{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:421acb5c0d2192be","name":"Force-Activated","source":{"id":"source:reference-421acb5c0d2192be","title":"Force-Activated","revision":20426,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:49:30Z","sha256":"1f7de59e404a7146a896d4c01374c12e1b823a1475de2f94b4c975d384b7dbb9","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20426","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Force-Activated&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-421acb5c0d2192be","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This rare ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," modification removes the activation button from the Lightsaber's exterior. To activate the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", the wielder must make a DC 5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". (This can be done as a part of drawing the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", as with normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," activation.) If this check fails, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," does not activate. Typically this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber Modification"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber_Modification"}," is used to ensure that untrained Force-users and those who have no sensitivity to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," cannot effectively use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
